WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.080
Our biggest fundraiser
of the year starts today.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:10.200
Every year, I ask you to help us
‘fill the carrot’ with your donations.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.480
For the fifth year in a row,

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:16.160
an amazing donor has stepped forward
and is providing a substantial match,

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.960
so if you make your contribution early,
you can have it doubled.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.440
If you've been part of the NutritionFacts
community for a long time,

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:27.320
you know that my passion for
nutrition and lifestyle medicine

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.600
was inspired by my grandmother's
recovery from heart disease.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.920
That's why I do what I do

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.920
and why our public health
nonprofit does what it does.

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:42.520
I hear from people every single day
about how their lives were changed

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.560
by the information found here
for free at NutritionFacts.org.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.920
Please help us continue and even
expand our work and our reach

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:53.120
to get this life-changing,
life-saving information

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.000
in front of as many
people as possible.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
We do not accept advertisements
or corporate sponsorships;

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.200
we're totally free.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:05.080
We don't sell you kitchen gadgets,
or supplements, or god knows.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.360
We just want you to live
the longest, healthiest life.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.680
I'd be honored to
receive your support.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.188
Please consider making a
tax-deductible donation today.

00:01:14.188 --> 00:01:23.520
On behalf of everyone at NutritionFacts,
staff and volunteers alike, thank you.

